    <bpmn:process id="W_W4346" name="W4346. Live-Goods Merchandising, Space &amp; Display (incl. Outdoor Yard)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Merchandising reset; seasonal change; space review
Frequency: Periodic + seasonal
Volume: Per-store garden-center space/display
Owner: Garden Buyer / Visual Merch (VS-55/VS-62) / Store Ops (VS-07)
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01), Visual Merch (VS-55), Store Ops (VS-07), Garden Ops, Marketing (VS-14)
Source: workflow W4346 — Live-Goods Merchandising, Space &amp; Display (incl. Outdoor Yard)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4346_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4346_Lane1" name="Garden Buyer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4346_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4346_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4346_Lane2" name="Garden Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4346_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4346_Lane3" name="Visual Merch">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4346_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4346_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4346_Start5" name="Merchandising reset; seasonal change; space review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4346_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4346_Task6" name="Garden Buyer/Visual Merch set the garden-center merchandising plan — zoning…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Garden Buyer/Visual Merch set the garden-center merchandising plan — zoning (sun/shade/pot-size), display fixtures, outdoor-yard layout, and signage, factoring plant light/water needs
Responsible (R): Garden Buyer / Visual Merch
Accountable (A): Head of Merch
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4346_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4346_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4346_Task7" name="Store/Garden Ops execute the plan, place plants in appropriate micro-zones, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store/Garden Ops execute the plan, place plants in appropriate micro-zones, and maintain display quality (grooming, deadhead, space)
Responsible (R): Garden Staff / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Store Mgr / Garden Ops Lead
Duration: Daily/periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4346_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4346_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4346_Task8" name="Visual Merch/Garden Ops audit display compliance &amp; plant health in-display, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Visual Merch/Garden Ops audit display compliance &amp; plant health in-display, and adjust for sell-through/season
Responsible (R): Visual Merch / Garden Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Merch
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4346_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4346_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4346_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4346_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-666 (ensure controlled execution — In-Store Garden Center Care, Merchandising &amp; Sell-Through (PA-145.2).) | - CTL-666: merchandising plan factored plant light/water needs; display groomed &amp; audited; compliance checked
Owner: Garden Buyer / Visual Merch (VS-55/VS-62) / Store Ops (VS-07)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4346_Assoc11" sourceRef="W4346_Annotation10" targetRef="W4346_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
