    <bpmn:process id="W_W4348" name="W4348. Live-Goods Customer Advisory, Plant Selection &amp; Guarantee" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer in garden center; advisory need
Frequency: Per customer interaction
Volume: Garden-center customer interactions
Owner: Garden Staff / Customer Experience (VS-13)
Participants: Garden Staff, CX (VS-13), Store Ops (VS-07), Sales Enablement (VS-124)
Source: workflow W4348 — Live-Goods Customer Advisory, Plant Selection &amp; Guarantee</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4348_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4348_Lane1" name="Garden Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4348_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4348_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4348_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4348_Lane2" name="CX">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4348_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4348_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4348_Start4" name="Customer in garden center; advisory need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4348_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4348_Task5" name="Garden staff advise customers on plant selection (site/climate/needs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Garden staff advise customers on plant selection (site/climate/needs, suitability, mature size, toxicity/pet-safety) using care content (W4343)
Responsible (R): Garden Staff
Accountable (A): Garden Ops Lead / Store Mgr
